1.0.0 (2026-11-13)
- First release: the WeeWX 5.5 Seasons skin for Ecowitt gateways.
- Current conditions and sensor status live from ecwLoop.json (weewx-ecowittGateway 2.0), with the
  last archive record as fallback.
- Interactive charts from weewx-echarts 1.0.0 instead of the ImageGenerator plots; charts and lines
  with no data are left out.
- No N/A anywhere: only values that are present are shown.
- Teal/green colours of the WeeWX documentation, with a dark theme.
